ll,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-10-09T10:26:38Z","label":{"name":"help wanted","color":"0E8A16"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/3393578072","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634#issuecomment-3393578072","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634","id":3393578072,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc7KReRY","user":{"login":"YueZheng-Sea-angle","id":62352027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzUyMDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62352027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle","html_url":"https://github.com/YueZheng-Sea-angle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-11T18:38:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T18:38:24Z","body":"Hi, I'm interested in contributing to fix this problem.\n\nAfter analyzing the codebase, I found the root cause: the A11y addon uses mixed state management - some states (like `results`) use `useAddonState` for persistence, while user preferences (`tab`, `highlighted`, `selectedItems`) use `useState` which gets reset when the component remounts during view mode transitions.\n\nI've identified three potential solutions:\n1. Migrate key states to `useAddonState` for persistence (minimal changes, recommended)\n2. Use localStorage for cross-session persistence \n3. Listen for view mode changes to save/restore state\n\nI believe Solution 1 has the smallest impact and lowest risk. I'm preparing a PR with this fix and would appreciate your guidance and feedback!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/3393578072/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"YueZheng-Sea-angle","id":62352027,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMzUyMDI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62352027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle","html_url":"https://github.com/YueZheng-Sea-angle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YueZheng-Sea-angle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/3416678162","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634#issuecomment-3416678162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634","id":3416678162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc7Lpl8S"