torybookjs/storybook","homepage":"https://storybook.js.org","size":1090866,"stargazers_count":88816,"watchers_count":88816,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":9808,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2246,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["angular","components","design-systems","documentation","html","javascript","react","react-native","stories","storybook","styleguide","svelte","testing","typescript","ui","vite","vue","web-components","webpack","workshop"],"visibility":"public","forks":9808,"open_issues":2246,"watchers":88816,"default_branch":"next","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/pulls/32762","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/32762","diff_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/32762.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/32762.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-27T13:17:10Z"},"body":"Problem:\r\nThe A11y panel UI state (selected tab and highlight toggle) is lost when navigating Stories → Docs → Stories. See #32634.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nPersist the A11y panel UI state with useAddonState so preferences survive navigation between Stories and Docs.\r\n- Persisted UI state: selected tab and highlighted are stored under a dedicated key across view-mode changes.\r\n- State initialization: on initial mount, the a11ySelection query param overrides any persisted state for deep-linking. The param is cleared after it’s read.\r\n- Minimal impact: only UI state handling changed; no changes to A11y checks or core logic.\r\n\r\nImplementation details:\r\n- New key:\r\n  - UI_STATE_ID = `${ADDON_ID}/ui`\r\n- State management:\r\n  ```ts\r\n  const [uiState, setUiState] = useAddonState(UI_STATE_ID, {\r\n    highlighted: false,\r\n    tab: RuleType.VIOLATION,\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const [tab, setTabState] = useState<RuleType>(() => {\r\n    const [type] = a11ySelection?.split('.') ?? [];\r\n    return type && Object.values(RuleType).includes(type as RuleType)\r\n      ? (type as RuleType)\r\n      : uiState.tab;\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  const [highlighted, setHighlighted] = useState<boolean>(() =>\r\n    a11ySelection ? true : uiState.highlighted\r\n  );\r\n  // a11ySelection precedence is applied once on mount; effect depends only on a11ySelection\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nFiles touched:\r\n- code/addons/a11y/src/constants.ts\r\n- code/addons/a11y/src/components/A11yContext.tsx\r\n- code/addons/a11y/src/components/A11yContext.test.tsx\r\n\r\nTest coverage:\r\n- Unit tests:\r\n  - Highlight toggle persists over re-mount\r\n  - Tab persists over re-mount\r\n  - a11ySelection overrides persisted state on initial mount\r\n\r\nManual testing:\r\n- yarn start → http://localhost:6006\r\n- Enable highlights, switch tabs, go to Docs, return — state persists\r\n\r\nRisks/considerations:\r\n- Unique useAddonState key avoids collisions\r\n- a11ySelection takes precedence once and is cleared\r\n- Only small UI booleans/enums are persisted\r\n\r\nFixes:\r\n- Fixes #32634\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Persisted UI state now stored under a dedicated UI namespace; new Status type added to the public API for addon lifecycle.\n* **Refactor**\n  * Internal state consolidated into a single composite addon state (ui, results, error, status); tab and highlights driven from ui and exposed via wrapper APIs.\n* **Tests**\n  * Tests updated to reflect the composite state shape and adjusted persistence/remount behavior.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32762/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/comments/3424584792","html_url":"https://github.com/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634#issuecomment-3424584792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/32634","id":3424584792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAzqfmc7MHwRY","user":{"login":"tysoncung","id":45380903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzgwOTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45380903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung","html_url":"https://github.com/tysoncung","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tysoncung/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T04:05:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T04:05:01Z","body":"This sounds like a useful feature! I'd be interested in contributing to this. Could you provide more details about the expected behavior and any specific requirements or constraints?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/